{"file":"indelible-0.1.6-v1.zip","bytes":733729,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"indelible","displayName":"indelible","description":"A self-study tutor for any subject: onboarding, diagnostic, closed-sheet sessions, 2-day cold rechecks, spaced mistake review and calendar planning. Built for Claude Code; in claude.ai chat and mobile, a limited manual mode.","version":"0.1.6","license":"MIT OR Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/romanprigodskii/indelible","homepage":"https://github.com/romanprigodskii/indelible","keywords":["learning","self-study","spaced-repetition","exam-prep","tutor"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/indelible/SKILL.md","name":"indelible","description":"Use when someone wants to learn, revise or prepare on their own over days or weeks (an exam, course final, certification, interview, language or programming skill): setting up study, starting, continuing or closing a study session, checking what is due, being tested on their material, having answers marked (photos or typed), reviewing their mistakes, or planning and rescheduling study time (their own revision timetable, a calendar), even if they never say \"study plan\". Also for a question on their subject in an indelible workspace (a folder with indelible.json). A strict tutor: onboarding, a diagnostic first, sheets read then closed, a 2-day cold recheck, spaced mistake review. In claude.ai chat or mobile: a limited manual mode. Not for: a single explanation, quiz or flashcard set with nothing to track, even before an exam; code review; work or meeting scheduling; marking other people's work; writing work the learner will hand in for assessment.","headings":["Setup (every invocation, before anything else)","Laws","Absolute bans","Commands","Routing","File contract","Surfaces","Without Python or a lasting folder"],"name_hint":"indelible","description_zh":"组织持续数天或数周的自主备考学习，管理学习会话、到期任务、测验评分、错题和时间安排，先诊断再学习并做两天后冷测与间隔复习；聊天移动端仅有限手动模式，不代写待提交作业或评他人作业，也不用于无跟踪的单次解释测验。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["indelible","The method","Where it works","Install","Example prompts","Try it with sample data","Commands","How a week looks","Your data","What it runs, writes and sends"]},{"path":"examples/README.md","headings":["Sample workspace","What's in it","Try it","How it differs from a real workspace","Rebuilding it"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/icon.svg",".claude-plugin/marketplace.json",".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitattributes",".github/workflows/ci.yml",".gitignore","CHANGELOG.md","LICENSE-APACHE","LICENSE-MIT","PRIVACY.md","README.md","SECURITY.md","dev/CONTRACT.md","dev/hooks/pre-push","dev/privacy_grep.py","evals/fixtures/persona-a.json","evals/fixtures/persona-b.json","evals/fixtures/persona-c.json","evals/fixtures/persona-d.json","evals/trigger.json","examples/README.md","examples/build_sample.py","examples/sample-workspace/.indelible/cal-results.json","examples/sample-workspace/.indelible/render.json","examples/sample-workspace/CLAUDE.md","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/errors/E-ielts-0001.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/errors/E-ielts-0002.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/ielts-diagnostic-01.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/ielts-headings-01-drills.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/ielts-headings-01-theory.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/keys/opened.jsonl","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/specs/ielts-diagnostic-01.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/specs/ielts-headings-01-drills.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/specs/ielts-headings-01-theory.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/tmp/ielts-diagnostic-01.grades.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/tmp/ielts-headings-01-drills.grades.json","examples/sample-workspace/ielts/.indelible/tmp/ielts-headings-01-theory.grades.json","examp